# The Wishing Potion (Q334), the wishes that answer on the spot: a started character holding
# five wish potions and Matild's orb. Each wish takes a potion (page 13 first, whose link the
# wish bypass needs); three seconds later Matild speaks, four seconds after that again, and four
# after that a third time, then the wish comes true: a certificate of royalty (wish 3, draw 0), an
# ancient crown (wish 3, draw 2), 10000 adena twice (wish 2, draws 1 and 2) and, for wish 4 with
# draw 0, one item of each of the three skill lists and a heart of Paagrio (draw 0 of three).
# The wishes that call something out (a fairy, demons, a chest) are in tests/quest/q334_spawns_test.go:
# a scenario cannot see or talk to an NPC a script spawns (#4020 item 5). Expectations replay the
# reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q334_the_wishing_potion_wishes.golden
character Seeker 30
quest Q334_TheWishingPotion <state>=STARTED <cond>=5
hold 3467 5
hold 3682 1
random 0 2 1 2 0 5 7 3 0
script quest.Q334_TheWishingPotion
item 57 3467 3468 3680 3681 3469 3077 3682 3942 3943 4200
page default/30738.htm
page script/quest/Q334_TheWishingPotion/
npc matild 30738 Folk 10 0 0

# Matild offers the recipes again only to a character without a potion: with one, the page is
# the event page itself and nothing is given.
action matild
action matild
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=matild item=0 page=default/30738.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{matild}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=matild item=0 page=script/quest/Q334_TheWishingPotion/30738-12.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest Q334_TheWishingPotion 30738-15a.htm
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=matild item=0 page=script/quest/Q334_TheWishingPotion/30738-15a.htm
  S ActionFailed
  items 3680=0 3681=0

